This directory contains a reduced copy of the "indicators" C++ progress bar library.

Upstream project: https://github.com/p-ranav/indicators
License: MIT
Authors: p-ranav and contributors (see upstream project for full list)

Files retained here (trimmed):
- progress_bar.hpp
- dynamic_progress.hpp
- setting.hpp
- color.hpp
- font_style.hpp
- progress_type.hpp
- terminal_size.hpp
- termcolor.hpp (third-party dependency, BSD-licensed by Ihor Kalnytskyi)
- display_width.hpp (includes the Unicode wcwidth implementation by Markus Kuhn)
- details/stream_helper.hpp

Third‑party components included by indicators:
- termcolor (BSD) by Ihor Kalnytskyi — https://github.com/ikalnytskyi/termcolor
- Unicode wcwidth/wcswidth by Markus Kuhn — permission notice included in display_width.hpp

This redistribution preserves the original license headers present in individual files
(see setting.hpp and display_width.hpp) and includes the full MIT license text in LICENSE.
